= Data and code availability

All code is available at #link("https://github.com/Dek0rta/flagged")[github.com/Dek0rta/flagged]. The essays are not redistributed; a script downloads them from their public sources (PERSUADE 2.0 and ELLIPSE under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0, Liang et al.'s essays under the MIT license, and the DAIGT v2 essays). Per-essay detector scores are released with the code, keyed by the corpora's essay identifiers.
